# Local, personal build assets only — never committed. Keeps trademarked/cosmetic art out of
# the clean-room source tree; the icon is compiled into crafter-sc only on this machine.
#
# The pattern is a GLOB, not three names: `app_icon_2/3/4.png` were committed straight past the
# two literal lines this file used to carry, referenced by nothing, and found only by an audit.
# A rename must not be able to defeat the rule the file exists to state.
app_icon*.png
app_icon*.ico
